  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.54381
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Meditation is the disciplined opening of the self to God.",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.744989,
      "end": 4.643288
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "Because of fear we are closed, and only love can become a door.",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/03.mp3",
      "start": 5.83941,
      "end": 9.676756999999998
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "So love more -",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/04.mp3",
      "start": 10.844172,
      "end": 12.025556
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "or rather be loving, then there is less fear and less tension, and you are more open.",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/05.mp3",
      "start": 13.215624,
      "end": 18.105397
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "This helps meditation as nothing else.",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/06.mp3",
      "start": 19.234989,
      "end": 21.511973
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Meditation plus love is the path.",
      "path": "audio/1971-279/07.mp3",
      "start": 22.956236,
      "end": 25.81
    }
  ]
}
